1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:03,530
Your boss messages you
at the end of your shift.

2
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:06,450
You already have dinner plans
or another commitment.

3
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:09,370
They ask you to stay
another half hour.

4
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,010
You agree because
you are afraid to say no.

5
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,710
And you miss your plans.

6
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:17,450
Every yes you say
when you want to say no

7
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:20,530
is like taking something
away from yourself.
